    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Martyrs is a grimdark <strong>survival horror </strong> about a nun in a space suit.\u00a0Inspired by games like <strong>Darkwood</strong> and\u00a0<strong>Signalis</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a future where the space race to the moon was won by the Church Space Program. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a novice nun that's been sent  on a cosmic crusade to repel a biomechanical plague in a quarantined zone around Heaven's Gate. Explore abandoned  drifting space-cathedrals and monasteries, to scavenge what resources you can. You'll need to balance your faith with you will to survive. Kill and be cursed, or stay faithful and find other ways to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/3783c4f4092799b1bd3ba2bcdc8c2969.poster.avif?t=1753357697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/3783c4f4092799b1bd3ba2bcdc8c2969.webm?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/3783c4f4092799b1bd3ba2bcdc8c2969.mp4?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way to recover the relic at the heart of each of the  abandoned locations, then hold-off the plague long enough to escape back to your ship. If you die a Saint, the Universal Church will just send another to recover your blessed remains and take up the mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/9af7fdef34decb1d1a4bbb0264e57b2d.poster.avif?t=1753357697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/9af7fdef34decb1d1a4bbb0264e57b2d.webm?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/9af7fdef34decb1d1a4bbb0264e57b2d.mp4?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong>\u00a0<strong>and fight</strong> for scraps amongst whatever lurks in the dark corners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong>\u00a0the tools and weapons to help you survive  amongst the silence.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/c446737a9312200c6f6fb9e057c14082.poster.avif?t=1753357697\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/c446737a9312200c6f6fb9e057c14082.webm?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/c446737a9312200c6f6fb9e057c14082.mp4?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> your faith levels which is impacted  by different action choices, unlocking Saintly or Cursed items and buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endure</strong> powerful stigmata and become imbued with divinity. Is it enough to hold back what's coming for you? </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/27b50bb707b47aefe4c0ee44f268aa08.poster.avif?t=1753357697\" width=614 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/27b50bb707b47aefe4c0ee44f268aa08.webm?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470850/extras/27b50bb707b47aefe4c0ee44f268aa08.mp4?t=1753357697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-<i>lite</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted grimdark art style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
